{"seq":2,"slug":"relations","title":"关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/relations","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"关系\">关系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关系（Relation）是集合论中描述元素之间联系的核心工具。形式化地，集合 A 到集合 B 的<strong>二元关系</strong> R 是笛卡尔积 A × B 的一个子集。当 (a, b) ∈ R 时，记作 aRb，表示&quot;a 与 b 之间存在关系 R&quot;。</p>\n<p>关系的概念极为广泛：数据库中的一张表就是一个关系，图中的边集就是顶点上的关系，程序中&quot;函数 A 调用函数 B&quot;定义了调用图上的关系。理解关系的各种性质和运算，是分析这些结构的数学基础。</p>\n<p>当 A = B 时，R 称为 A 上的关系。A 上的关系在分析中最为常见——等价关系、偏序关系都是 A 上的关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[关系 R ⊆ A × B]&#10;    A --&gt; B[性质]&#10;    A --&gt; C[运算]&#10;    A --&gt; D[特殊关系]&#10;    B --&gt; E[自反性]&#10;    B --&gt; F[对称性]&#10;    B --&gt; G[传递性]&#10;    B --&gt; H[反对称性]&#10;    C --&gt; I[复合]&#10;    C --&gt; J[逆关系]&#10;    C --&gt; K[闭包]&#10;    D --&gt; L[等价关系]&#10;    D --&gt; M[偏序关系]\">graph TB\n    A[关系 R ⊆ A × B]\n    A --&gt; B[性质]\n    A --&gt; C[运算]\n    A --&gt; D[特殊关系]\n    B --&gt; E[自反性]\n    B --&gt; F[对称性]\n    B --&gt; G[传递性]\n    B --&gt; H[反对称性]\n    C --&gt; I[复合]\n    C --&gt; J[逆关系]\n    C --&gt; K[闭包]\n    D --&gt; L[等价关系]\n    D --&gt; M[偏序关系]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>编程对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自反性</td>\n<td>∀a: aRa</td>\n<td>= (等于)</td>\n<td><code>x === x</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称性</td>\n<td>aRb → bRa</td>\n<td>朋友关系</td>\n<td>无向边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反对称性</td>\n<td>aRb ∧ bRa → a=b</td>\n<td>≤ (小于等于)</td>\n<td>弱序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递性</td>\n<td>aRb ∧ bRc → aRc</td>\n<td>&lt; (小于)</td>\n<td>排序可传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非自反性</td>\n<td>∀a: ¬(aRa)</td>\n<td>&lt; (严格小于)</td>\n<td><code>x &lt; x</code> 为假</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关系的性质分析\">关系的性质分析</h2><p>一个集合上的二元关系最重要的四个性质是自反性、对称性、反对称性和传递性。这些性质的不同组合产生了不同类型的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>自反性</strong>（Reflexive）：每个元素都与自身有关系。∀a ∈ A: aRa。&quot;等于&quot;关系是自反的（每个数等于自身），&quot;小于&quot;关系不是自反的（没有数小于自身）。</p>\n<p><strong>对称性</strong>（Symmetric）：如果 a 与 b 有关系，则 b 也与 a 有关系。aRb → bRa。&quot;是朋友&quot;是对称的，&quot;是父亲&quot;不是对称的。在图论中，对称关系对应无向图。</p>\n<p><strong>反对称性</strong>（Antisymmetric）：如果 a 与 b 互有关系，则 a = b。aRb ∧ bRa → a = b。&quot;小于等于&quot;是反对称的：a ≤ b 且 b ≤ a 意味着 a = b。注意对称性和反对称性不是互斥的——集合上的等于关系同时满足这两个性质。</p>\n<p><strong>传递性</strong>（Transitive）：关系可以&quot;传递&quot;。aRb ∧ bRc → aRc。&quot;祖先&quot;关系是传递的：a 是 b 的祖先，b 是 c 的祖先，则 a 是 c 的祖先。传递性在依赖分析中至关重要——如果模块 A 依赖 B，B 依赖 C，则 A 传递依赖 C。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Relation&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  elements: T[];&#10;  pairs: [T, T][];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const isReflexive = &lt;T&gt;(rel: Relation&lt;T&gt;): boolean =&gt;&#10;  rel.elements.every((a) =&gt; rel.pairs.some(([x, y]) =&gt; x === a &amp;&amp; y === a));&#10;&#10;const isSymmetric = &lt;T&gt;(rel: Relation&lt;T&gt;): boolean =&gt;&#10;  rel.pairs.every(([a, b]) =&gt; rel.pairs.some(([x, y]) =&gt; x === b &amp;&amp; y === a));&#10;&#10;const isTransitive = &lt;T&gt;(rel: Relation&lt;T&gt;): boolean =&gt;&#10;  rel.pairs.every(([a, b]) =&gt;&#10;    rel.pairs.filter(([x]) =&gt; x === b).every(([, c]) =&gt; rel.pairs.some(([x, y]) =&gt; x === a &amp;&amp; y === c)),&#10;  );\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Relation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  elements</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pairs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isReflexive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Relation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rel.elements.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSymmetric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Relation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isTransitive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Relation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rel.pairs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(([</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"等价关系与等价类\">等价关系与等价类</h2><p>同时满足<strong>自反性、对称性和传递性</strong>的关系称为<strong>等价关系</strong>。等价关系是&quot;相等&quot;概念的推广——它刻画了&quot;在某种意义下相同&quot;。</p>\n<p>等价关系最重要的性质是它将集合<strong>划分</strong>为若干互不相交的子集，每个子集称为一个<strong>等价类</strong>。反过来，集合的任何划分都对应一个等价关系。这个一一对应被称为<strong>等价关系-划分定理</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等价关系示例</th>\n<th>集合</th>\n<th>等价类</th>\n<th>编程对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模 3 同余</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>{0,3,6,...}, {1,4,7,...}, {2,5,8,...}</td>\n<td>哈希桶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同类型</td>\n<td>值</td>\n<td>整数集、字符串集、...</td>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通性</td>\n<td>图的顶点</td>\n<td>各连通分量</td>\n<td>并查集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同源文件</td>\n<td>代码行</td>\n<td>各源文件</td>\n<td>模块系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 等价关系&#10;        A[自反性] --- B[对称性]&#10;        B --- C[传递性]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 等价类划分&#10;        D[类1]&#10;        E[类2]&#10;        F[类3]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D ---|互不相交| E&#10;    E ---|互不相交| F\">graph TB\n    subgraph 等价关系\n        A[自反性] --- B[对称性]\n        B --- C[传递性]\n    end\n    subgraph 等价类划分\n        D[类1]\n        E[类2]\n        F[类3]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; F\n    D ---|互不相交| E\n    E ---|互不相交| F</pre><p>在编程中，<strong>并查集</strong>（Union-Find）是处理等价关系最经典的数据结构。它支持两个操作：<code>find(x)</code> 查找 x 所在的等价类代表元，<code>union(x, y)</code> 将 x 和 y 所在的等价类合并。并查集在社交网络的连通性分析、图像分割、Kruskal 最小生成树算法中都有重要应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class UnionFind {&#10;  private parent: number[];&#10;  private rank: number[];&#10;&#10;  constructor(n: number) {&#10;    this.parent = Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) =&gt; i);&#10;    this.rank = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  find(x: number): number {&#10;    if (this.parent[x] !== x) {&#10;      this.parent[x] = this.find(this.parent[x]);&#10;    }&#10;    return this.parent[x];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  union(x: number, y: number): void {&#10;    const px = this.find(x);&#10;    const py = this.find(y);&#10;    if (px === py) return;&#10;    if (this.rank[px] &lt; this.rank[py]) this.parent[px] = py;&#10;    else if (this.rank[px] &gt; this.rank[py]) this.parent[py] = px;&#10;    else {&#10;      this.parent[py] = px;&#10;      this.rank[px]++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnionFind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: n }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shik